                        <span class="story-tag">Therapy</span>
                        <h3>Breathing Exercises for Beginners</h3>
                        <p>Simple techniques to ease your first session.</p>
                    </div>
                </a>

                <a class="story-card">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1499209974431-9dddcece7f88?w=600&h=450&fit=crop" alt="Journaling for wellbeing">
                    <div class="story-content">
                        <span class="story-tag">Insights</span>
                        <h3>The Power of Daily Journaling</h3>
                        <p>Write your way to better mental clarity.</p>
                    </div>
                </a>

                <a class="story-card">
